  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="Формула (LaTeX)">
      <data key="d0">Формула (LaTeX)</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
      <data key="d2">Формула (LaTeX) represents a mathematical equation or expression written in LaTeX format. It involves variables and constants, and can be presented as "Formula (LaTeX): a^2 + b^2 = c^2". The entity is consistently described as a mathematical formula represented using LaTeX notation. Despite multiple mentions of the same description, no conflicting information was found regarding its nature or components.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-2a0888349718f5f2a20c6800cad13bbc-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e104e211de2f2d77ed73269623c39fd2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-600a0c78af3d801d6496e749bbc4d6d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-0d651681504c3b0d71951fb02e88df36-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-2b2765c1dc3c0924781f469247feb1d3-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7bfc174e21f4323485b564b4ffe791be-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-9d0dd84a0be328b9a9b4a65c28c5d2ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b43fc5cd8aa611e5651d7cf5010dcc6b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-03a5738df2fb27efe596a610bf0b8dfe-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b176d9daac368c608373bc3d18f28da-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-952ae85bc165a99a8207d50d0e4db44c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93205e0c8c751a55081db85cf6bc6a62-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-946f7f65b47d02934ef52ad10ee466e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0522860145c2ef82958731f8d13ec3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b5a606db4a1d6eb64b1b4f497a8a132-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a0dbd6564ebc2644ef1cc840ebfe51a2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a83710e679a36bae4dc9d13ef1fef596-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-77e6c803852efe2c5d828dcee4d05d91-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-11de9f184a1af74ecd6088c319b89229-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-23ec8458fb7fe841de5f228bb737b76f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f0395eac2737141afd769deb5c6140ea-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b1e4448e5c567fada0f6d4ba573209ab-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
