    <node id="LaTeX">
      <data key="d0">LaTeX</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-93b6acd960d94a31188c3d66a7ec9b38-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3686830df420ce5a2ede2561e500fcdd-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d4241bc197dcc704273a7b7e735b97ac-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-952ae85bc165a99a8207d50d0e4db44c-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b1de46266243c31cf0c96ded454f6a13-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c5ba0dcacc2438267b920d857cb7d2c1-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f205ae5d73886267042a8e0600bd6703-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d2">The formula D = b^2 - 4ac is written using LaTeX notation.&lt;SEP&gt;LaTeX refers to a document preparation system used for typesetting mathematical expressions.&lt;SEP&gt;A mathematical formula represented by the identifier "formula_14".&lt;SEP&gt;LaTeX refers to a document preparation system used for the given mathematical formula.&lt;SEP&gt;LaTeX refers to a document preparation system used for typesetting.&lt;SEP&gt;LaTeX refers to a document preparation system used for formatting the mathematical formula.</data>
      <data key="d1">content</data>
