    <node id="π">
      <data key="d0">π</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">π (Pi) is a mathematical constant representing the ratio of a circle's circumference to its diameter.&lt;SEP&gt;Represents the mathematical constant pi (π).&lt;SEP&gt;π is the mathematical constant representing pi, used in the formula for calculating the surface area of a sphere.&lt;SEP&gt;π stands for Pi, an irrational number used in the formula.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-30bb8cabb1c868341358d6696111eff8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f5be1dcdffe74abbdfd357496fb974c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8338d84cbfe7914211255ac9d9e4b49b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-619df480f7f496293a883f5ec6e99477-chunk-000</data>
