      <data key="d2">r stands for the radius of a circle in the formula.&lt;SEP&gt;Represents the radius of a circle.&lt;SEP&gt;r represents the radius in the mathematical expression.&lt;SEP&gt;r stands for the radius of a sphere and appears alongside π in the given formula.&lt;SEP&gt;r denotes the radius of a sphere in the formula.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-30bb8cabb1c868341358d6696111eff8-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f5be1dcdffe74abbdfd357496fb974c9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-106004f57852517ecd8ca29edb181bb6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8338d84cbfe7914211255ac9d9e4b49b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-619df480f7f496293a883f5ec6e99477-chunk-000</data>
