      <data key="d1">function</data>
      <data key="d2">f is described as a function of g, indicating it's an input to the relationship with g.&lt;SEP&gt;f represents a function that operates on x within the provided context.&lt;SEP&gt;f represents a function to be integrated with respect to x.</data>
