    <node id="sin">
      <data key="d0">sin</data>
      <data key="d1">function</data>
      <data key="d2">Sin is a trigonometric function that takes an angle (represented by x) as its argument. It also appears within integrands and functions derived through integration processes such as integrating cos(x). The sine function results in squaring the cosine of x and then subtracting it from 2, indicating its role in certain formulas. Additionally, sin is a component used in equations and trigonometric relationships.&lt;SEP&gt;sin is a trigonometric function representing sine of an angle.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-9d0dd84a0be328b9a9b4a65c28c5d2ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b43fc5cd8aa611e5651d7cf5010dcc6b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7b176d9daac368c608373bc3d18f28da-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-946f7f65b47d02934ef52ad10ee466e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0522860145c2ef82958731f8d13ec3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b5a606db4a1d6eb64b1b4f497a8a132-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a0dbd6564ebc2644ef1cc840ebfe51a2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a83710e679a36bae4dc9d13ef1fef596-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b1de46266243c31cf0c96ded454f6a13-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93a94f006c522d695912e86f3a1ab972-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c5ba0dcacc2438267b920d857cb7d2c1-chunk-000</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d5">1781008071</data>
      <data key="d6" />
    </node>
    <node id="cos">
      <data key="d0">cos</data>
      <data key="d1">function</data>
      <data key="d2">Cosine (cos) is a trigonometric function that depends on the variable x. It is used in integrals and formulas, often alongside sine (sin). The cosine function represents an angle and is related to its derivative, which is negative sine (sin). It appears as a key component in mathematical expressions.&lt;SEP&gt;cos is a trigonometric function representing cosine of an angle.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-9d0dd84a0be328b9a9b4a65c28c5d2ec-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b43fc5cd8aa611e5651d7cf5010dcc6b-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-946f7f65b47d02934ef52ad10ee466e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b0522860145c2ef82958731f8d13ec3e-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-3b5a606db4a1d6eb64b1b4f497a8a132-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a0dbd6564ebc2644ef1cc840ebfe51a2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a83710e679a36bae4dc9d13ef1fef596-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-77e6c803852efe2c5d828dcee4d05d91-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b1de46266243c31cf0c96ded454f6a13-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-93a94f006c522d695912e86f3a1ab972-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c5ba0dcacc2438267b920d857cb7d2c1-chunk-000</data>
